{{also|Shamus}}
==English==

===Etymology===
Said to be from the Irish name [[Séamus]], on account of many American police officers being of Irish descent.

===Pronunciation===
* {{enPR|shä'məs}}, {{IPA|/ˈʃɑːməs/|lang=en}}
* {{enPR|shā'məs}}, {{IPA|/ˈʃeɪməs/|lang=en}}
* {{rhymes|eɪməs|lang=en}}
* Homophones: [[Seamus]] (''of'' -ā-/-eɪ-/<tt>-eI-</tt> ''pronunciation'')

===Noun===
{{en-noun|es}}

# {{lb|en|US|slang}} A [[private detective]]; originally, a policeman or police detective.
